1
00:00:00,109 --> 00:00:00,909
Shark
鲨鱼

2
00:00:01,006 --> 00:00:03,172
This big grey animal lives in the sea
这种灰色的大动物生活在海里

3
00:00:03,246 --> 00:00:06,692
It's got a very big mouth and a lot of teeth
它有一张很大的嘴和很多牙齿

4
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:08,412
It can sometimes eat people
它有时会吃人

5
00:00:08,483 --> 00:00:09,080
Dolphin
海豚

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,726
This grey animal lives in the sea
这种灰色的动物生活在海里

7
00:00:10,727 --> 00:00:13,445
It's got a long e and small teeth
它有一个长e和小牙齿

8
00:00:13,446 --> 00:00:16,012
It's very clever and it likes playing
它很聪明，喜欢玩耍

9
00:00:16,185 --> 00:00:16,966
Kangaroo
袋鼠

10
00:00:16,966 --> 00:00:19,492
This big brown animal lives in Australia
这种棕色的大动物生活在澳大利亚

11
00:00:19,806 --> 00:00:23,932
It's got two long strong legs and two short thin arms
它有两条又长又壮的腿和两条又短又细的胳膊

12
00:00:23,932 --> 00:00:24,931
It can jump
它能跳

13
00:00:24,986 --> 00:00:25,606
Parrot
鹦鹉

14
00:00:25,606 --> 00:00:27,091
This animal can fly
这种动物会飞

15
00:00:27,327 --> 00:00:28,140
It eats fruit
它吃水果

16
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:31,166
It can be red green and blue an it's very loud
它可以是红色、绿色和蓝色，而且声音很大。

17
00:00:31,166 --> 00:00:31,486
Bat
蝙蝠

18
00:00:31,486 --> 00:00:35,371
This small black or brown animal can fly but it isn't a bird
这种黑色或棕色的小动物会飞，但它不是鸟。

19
00:00:35,686 --> 00:00:37,500
It eats fruit and insects
它吃水果和昆虫

20
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,892
